{"availability":"available","full":"suhail-akhtar/aico","name":"aico","description":"Self-hosted, bring-your-own-key AI agent — desktop app with an IDE and a private, protected AI browser; alternative to Devin, Replit Agent, Lovable, Bolt.new, Claude Code and Codex. No markup — pay your provider directly, or run local Ollama free. Free for personal use (PolyForm Noncommercial).","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-17T12:45:53Z","updated":"2026-10-09T19:27:07Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://suhail-akhtar.github.io/aico/","topics":["agentic-ai","ai-agent","ai-coding-agent","anthropic","autonomous-agents","byok","claude","cli","coding-agent","coding-assistant","deepseek","devin-alternative","gemini","mcp","model-context-protocol","ollama","open-source-alternative","openai","replit-alternative","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://suhail-akhtar.github.io/aico/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:16.008Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:16.008Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:16.008Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T19:34:16.008Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["⬇ Download the desktop app · Website · Guide · How it compares · Changelog","AICO is an AI agent that works on your computer, for you, with your own key. It writes and fixes real code, plans and builds whole apps and proves they work in a real browser, drives a browser of its own, runs long jobs without losing the thread — and answers everyday questions with maps, charts, forecasts, videos and documents you can edit. One engine, four ways in: a native desktop app, VS Code, a local web portal and the terminal.","It is built around one idea other agents skip: every request is derived from an append-only event log. That single decision is why its prompt cache hits 79–96% of the time, why it can run for hours without forgetting what you asked, why you can steer it mid-run, and why every answer can show exactly what it read."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/suhail-akhtar/aico/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"80556af810d36c79332499ac96fc96592dd31f14c56a26e4b4614c7d2ce2c969","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:16.109Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:16.109Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"⬇ Download the desktop app · Website · Guide · How it compares · Changelog","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/suhail-akhtar/aico/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Trackers and third-party cookies blocked, HTTPS-first, Global Privacy Control sent, a Chrome-standard identity with no \"Electron\" fingerprint, and everything it learns stays on this computer — no telemetry, no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/suhail-akhtar/aico/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"It can sign in from the vault on the site a credential belongs to, without the value ever reaching the model.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/suhail-akhtar/aico/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"80556af810d36c79332499ac96fc96592dd31f14c56a26e4b4614c7d2ce2c969","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/suhail-akhtar/aico/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:16.110Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T19:27:07Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/suhail-akhtar/aico/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:16.113Z","hash":"80556af810d36c79332499ac96fc96592dd31f14c56a26e4b4614c7d2ce2c969","originalBytes":48928,"storedBytes":48928,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["aico","every","agent","what","model","own","code","real","never","browser","run","each","one","desktop","only","tools","checks","files","npm","page","before","runs","tool","work","web","any","app","live","ask","full","when","agents","api","key","read","about","chat","request","after","plan","provider","skills","